observed = "The original touch declaration named only four example directories, while the task explicitly requires locked workspace, release, documentation, Make and CI scenario wiring and the retained merchant-checkout compatibility package. The touch list is expanded to those exact integration surfaces so strict guard describes the implementation rather than hiding necessary out-of-scope files. cg sync skips package-lock.json, so the declared package*.json family is witnessed by the indexed package.json while still scope-covering the lockfile change."
