assumption = "The protocol owner must bind MigrationPlane to the real binding and custody operations and provision exact receipt policies. Human qualification must then exercise wallet binding, custody deposit, protocol credit, receipt verification, history sink durability, retries, reorgs and every injected failure against both real test networks before task 24.1 can be marked done."
