observed = "The existing canonical Paxeer finality client accepts HTTP JSON-RPC endpoints and does not define public-Internet TLS credentials. The deployment therefore confines those exact clients to NetworkPolicy-selected internal Paxeer RPC services while the operator custody broadcast/signing boundary is separately mTLS authenticated. Durable observations compare inclusion block hashes across polls and record displacement rather than retaining stale finality."
assumption = "The Paxeer operator must provide authenticated internal RPC transport or extend the canonical client with an owner-approved HTTPS/mTLS profile before any public endpoint is configured. Human qualification must inject endpoint disagreement, receipt disappearance, changed inclusion blocks and finality-depth regressions and must confirm no displaced transaction is counted as available inventory."
severity = "custody-boundary"

