assumption = "The node/archive owner must extend a versioned archive format with the complete protocol-owned checkpoint proof and independently provisioned bonded-set and registration trust roots. Qualification must verify that new evidence across all SDKs before checkpoint-finalised or settlement-anchored mirror levels may be displayed."
