symbol = "Deprecation::transition_legacy, Deprecation::read_legacy"
observed = "ABI one had no program-account registration activity or account-tree balance proof. Its lifecycle history remains replayable only behind an explicit ABI-one gate with an empty durable program-account enumeration; caller-declared legacy balances are not imported as real value. ABI two deprecation requires the immediate pre-transition receipt-backed account snapshot and complete durable binding enumeration."
