observed = "Workspace BUILD logs 003, 005 and 014 all stopped while parsing interop/Cargo.toml. The manifest contained duplicate rustls and subtle keys appended after native-tls; the repair removes the later duplicates and retains the earlier identically pinned workspace dependencies. The reported layerx-mirror edition-inheritance failures were downstream parse errors, not a separate edition defect."
assumption = "Human qualification must resume the agent, platform Rust and interop builds and regenerate any affected lockfiles through Cargo if the now-parseable manifests report locked-resolution drift."
