assumption = "Human qualification must exercise a clean checkout after the HPX registry publishes versioned, checksum-bound native artifacts; prove the build obtains the exact x86_64 and aarch64 libraries without committing local build output; and retain failure on missing or mismatched artifacts. Until then, the source import and workflow relocation are implementation evidence only, not a successful Paxeer build claim."
