observed = "The first owner-authorized public deployment started the checksum-bound registry runtime successfully on 127.0.0.1:8099, but public artifact requests returned 404 because the immutable release root retained mktemp's owner-only directory mode, and the landing-page alias returned 500 because Nginx appended its index name to the file alias. The publisher now makes the fully assembled release root traversable before the atomic current-pointer switch, and the exact root location resolves the installed page through a bounded web root."
