observed = "The workspace aggregates now explicitly inventory the root protocol, contracts, Agent, Human, Platform, Programs, Interop, specification generator, Paxeer chain and independently rooted Paxeer Foundry, Cargo, Go and npm projects. Locked install is a separate action; BUILD does not mutate dependency state. The ordinary test aggregate covers local replay, contracts, recovery and arithmetic qualification, reproducibility, consensus policy and sanitizer gates, while exact inventory checks reject undeclared Paxeer manifest roots or removal of declared core gates. The three parallelization CosmWasm crates now carry committed Cargo locks and participate in locked fetch plus offline build, test and clippy. The load-test Foundry project now carries revision- and checksum-recorded OpenZeppelin v5.3.0 and Solmate v6 source dependencies, exact remappings and a local digest verifier, and participates in build, test and format checks without its former curl, apt or floating forge-install setup. No aggregate command was executed in this implementation phase, so this records scope only and does not claim a build, test, lint or qualification result."
